"note_claim": "The claim of 62 million visits misattributes traffic from Motherless.com, a porn site with related content, to the group itself.",
"label": "SUPPORTS",
"quote": "The website, which had around 62 million visits in February alone and whose core audience is in the United States, describes itself as a \"moral free file host where anything legal is hosted forever.\"",
"reason": "The article explicitly attributes the 62 million visits figure to Motherless.com, confirming the note's correction that this traffic statistic does not apply to the Telegram group."
